Z||000001||Phaeton||03-01-2000||11:15 PM||||Holey Moley, it's a pain to change.  It involves removing carpet trim, threading cables, raising Fiero, and etc. etc.<P>If it really has to be done the local library might have something in the reference section with a picture available for copy.<P>OR...maybe a forum member with a scanner and instruction manual.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Brian84SE||03-02-2000||05:47 AM||||I did it. Phaeton is right, what a pain.  I do remember using the Haynes manual and it was pretty good.  If you have any specific questions I would be glad to help.||||reg||1
